	(text "RK3588 units 11 and 13, with rail assignment and decoupling from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic,\nsheet 10. The MEM pin groups share their core rail, except CPU_BIG1_MEM which has its own rail.\nNet ties join each remotely sensed rail to its _FB sense net; place them at the processor balls.\nAll 421 ground balls are stacked on the single VSS pin of the ground unit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
